# Default User Roles

These roles must be seeded automatically on install; see `permissions.mdc` for access semantics.

## Shipped Roles

- `super_admin`: platform manage, all active modules.
- `tenant_admin`: tenant manage, all entitled modules.
- `facility_admin`: facility manage, facility modules.
- `integration_admin`: integrations and reports_audit.
- `doctor`: clinical care, diagnostics, and billing visibility.
- `nurse`: ward care, triage, diagnostics, and registry.
- `receptionist`: registration, queues, and billing.
- `accountant`: billing, claims, and reporting.
- `pharmacist`: dispensing, stock, billing view.
- `laboratory_technician`: lab work.
- `radiographer`: radiology scan workflow.
- `radiologist`: imaging interpretation.
- `physiotherapist`: therapy workflow.
- `discharge_planner`: discharge coordination.
- `operations_staff`, `housekeeper`, `biomedical_engineer`, `mortuary_attendant`: their own modules.
- `hr_staff`: HR administration.
- `patient`: own-data only.
- `visitor_guest`: limited visitor info.

## Administration

- Admins may add custom roles using the same vocabulary.
- Reset must restore this shipped matrix atomically.
- Failed changes must roll back completely and stay auditable.
- Frontend and backend must deny unauthorized menus, actions, and workflows.

